      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, my legs have been cramping so bad lately and i just feel really wiped out all the time. i read online that it might be low potassium... i have stage 3 kidney disease so i have to be somewhat careful, but do u think it's okay if i just start taking some 99mg potassium supplements like 3 or 4 times a day to see if that fixes the cramps?",
